# Auto detect text files and normalize to LF in the repo and the working tree.
# `eol=lf` is required: gates hash and lint over LF (DESIGN.md authority hash,
# prettier endOfLine=lf), and Windows checkouts with autocrlf would otherwise
# materialize CRLF and fail them (observed on GitHub Actions windows runners).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
